 H4-sw cells.", annotationSpecies:["10090"], annotationCell:["glioblast"], pmid:"22001921", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"22001921", annotationRace:["Swedish"]}}, {start: {_id:4606}, end: {_id:4607}, properties:{evidence:"In AD cases Hypomethylated/up-regulated genes in H4-sw cells are- HOXD4,FAM58A,SCMH1,CTIF,PCDHB15,DKK2,MRTO4,PDPN,LHPP,CRYAB,PPP4C,L3MBTL,SLC38A3,OGDHL, DNAJC7,WT1,SLC6A11,RERG,RBM47,TMEM180,CYP26A1,COLEC10,NXT2. Hypermethylated/down-regulated genes DDR2,CRMP1,ACAD11,QDPR,PLAC8,DLK2 in H4-sw cells.", annotationSpecies:["10090"], annotationCell:["glioblast"], pmid:"22001921", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"22001921", annotationRace:["Swedish"]}}, {start: {_id:4621}, end: {_id:4623}, properties:{annotationEncodeFeatureTypes:["Promoter"], evidence:"Further chromatin immunoprecipitation and bisulfite sequencing studies illustrated the decreased cytosine methylation in the Cdk5 promoter region in hippocampal CA1 in the rodent model of AD", annotationSubgraph:["Cyclin-CDK subgraph"], annotationSpecies:["10116"], annotationMeshanatomy:["Hippocampus"], pmid:"25234403", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"25234403"}}, {start: {_id:1188}, end: {_id:4626}, properties:{annotationEncodeFeatureTypes:["Promoter"], evidence:"BACE1 mRNA levels were increased in aged 3xTg-AD mice as well as in AD PBMCs along with an increase in promoter accessibility and histone H3 acetylation, while the BACE1 promoter region was less accessible in PBMCs from MCI individuals", annotationSpecies:["10090"], annotationCell:["blood cell"], annotationUserdefinedcellline:["App transgenic"], pmid:"22728099", annotationDisease:["Alzheimer's disease"], citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"22728099"}}, {start: {_id:4630}, end: {_id:4629}, properties:{annotationEncodeFeatureTypes:["Promoter"], evidence:"Ncstn was downregulated in aged 3xTg-AD brains with a condensation of chromatin and Sirt1 mRNA levels were decreased in these animals despite alterations in histone H3 acetylation", annotationSpecies:["10090"], annotationCell:["blood cell"], annotationUserdefinedcellline:["App transgenic"], pmid:"22728099", annotationDisease:["Alzheimer's disease"], citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"22728099"}}, {start: {_id:4611}, end: {_id:4633}, properties:{annotationEncodeFeatureTypes:["Promoter"], evidence:"Ncstn was downregulated in aged 3xTg-AD brains with a condensation of chromatin and Sirt1 mRNA levels were decreased in these animals despite alterations in histone H3 acetylation", annotationSpecies:["10090"], annotationCell:["blood cell"], annotationUserdefinedcellline:["App transgenic"], pmid:"22728099", annotationDisease:["Alzheimer's disease"], citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"22728099"}}, {start: {_id:4677}, end: {_id:587}, properties:{annotationEncodeFeatureTypes:["Promoter"], evidence:"the demethylation of Presenilin1 gene promoter in nutritionally- induced hyperhomocysteinemia in a transgenic mouse model clearly demonstrated that Presenilin1 is regulated by DNA methylation.", annotationSpecies:["10090"], pmid:"22272624", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"22272624"}}] AS row
