CDK5/p25-dependent phosphorylation of DARPP-32 in mouse striatum slices in vitro.", annotationSubgraph:["Cyclin-CDK subgraph"], annotationConfidence:["Medium"], pmid:"10998059", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"10998059"}}] AS row
