UNWIND [{start: {_id:3923}, end: {_id:663}, properties:{evidence:"Furthermore, overexpression of miR-195 in N2a/APP decreased the level of Abeta, while inhibition of miR-195 resulted in an increase of Abeta. Thus, we demonstrated that miR-195 could downregulate the level of Abeta by inhibiting the translation of BACE1. We conclude that miR-195 might provide a therapeutic strategy for AD", annotationSubgraph:["Beta secretase subgraph", "miRNA subgraph"], pmid:"22721728", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"22721728"}}] AS row
