phorylation, leading to a downregulation of the autophagy-lysosome pathway (ATG12, ATG5, cathepsin B, p62, LC3) and alters the volume of autophagic vacuoles.", annotationSubgraph:["mTOR signaling subgraph"], annotationMeshanatomy:["Vacuoles", "Lysosomes"], pmid:"24556681", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"24556681"}}, {start: {_id:4196}, end: {_id:4200}, properties:{evidence:"Ethanol also upregulates mTOR phosphorylation, leading to a downregulation of the autophagy-lysosome pathway (ATG12, ATG5, cathepsin B, p62, LC3) and alters the volume of autophagic vacuoles.", annotationSubgraph:["mTOR signaling subgraph"], annotationMeshanatomy:["Vacuoles", "Lysosomes"], pmid:"24556681", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"24556681"}}, {start: {_id:4207}, end: {_id:4210}, properties:{evidence:"Our data show that NRG1-beta decreased the levels of VCAM-1, E-selectin, and neutrophil adhesion to brain microvascular endothelial cells activated by IL1-beta.", annotationMeshanatomy:["Neutrophils", "Brain", "Endothelial Cells"], annotationConfidence:["High"], pmid:"24863743", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"24863743"}}, {start: {_id:4207}, end: {_id:4211}, properties:{evidence:"Our data show that NRG1-beta decreased the levels of VCAM-1, E-selectin, and neutrophil adhesion to brain microvascular endothelial cells activated by IL1-beta.", annotationMeshanatomy:["Neutrophils", "Brain", "Endothelial Cells"], annotationConfidence:["High"], pmid:"24863743", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"24863743"}}, {start: {_id:4228}, end: {_id:4229}, properties:{evidence:"knockdown of Runx1t1 significantly decreased the expression level of cell cycle-related gene, cyclin-dependent kinase 4 (Cdk4) and proliferation index in activated BV2 microglia.", annotationSubgraph:["Cyclin-CDK subgraph"], annotationMeshanatomy:["Microglia"], annotationConfidence:["Medium"], pmid:"24586690", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"24586690"}}, {start: {_id:4276}, end: {_id:2493}, properties:{evidence:"In addition, BK reduced Abeta-induced expression of proinflammatory genes including iNOS and COX-2.", annotationSubgraph:["Inflammatory response subgraph"], annotationMeshanatomy:["Brain"], annotationConfidence:["Medium"], pmid:"20937084", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"20937084"}}, {start: {_id:4276}, end: {_id:4277}, properties:{evidence:"In addition, BK reduced Abeta-induced expression of proinflammatory genes including iNOS and COX-2.", annotationSubgraph:["Inflammatory response subgraph"], annotationMeshanatomy:["Brain"], annotationConfidence:["Medium"], pmid:"20937084", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"20937084"}}, {start: {_id:2441}, end: {_id:4280}, properties:{evidence:"Silencing the ATF4 gene using RNAi inhibited GRP78 stimulation.", annotationSubgraph:["Chaperone subgraph"], pmid:"24638036", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"24638036"}}, {start: {_id:4313}, end: {_id:4269}, properties:{evidence:"Middle cerebral artery occlusion (MCAO) induced development of ischemia, and ischemic neuronal cell death were reduced in IL-32Î±-overexpressing transgenic mice (IL-32Î± mice) brain through the decreased release of neuroinflammatory cytokines (IL-6, IL-1beta, TNF-Î±) and activation of astrocytes, but enhancement of anti- neuroinflammatory cytokines (IL-10).", annotationSubgraph:["Interleukin signaling subgraph"], annotationSpecies:["10090"], annotationMeshdisease:["Infarction, Middle Cerebral Artery", "Ischemia"], annotationMeshanatomy:["Middle Cerebral Artery", "Astrocytes", "Brain"], annotationConfidence:["Medium"], pmid:"24854197", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"24854197"}}, {start: {_id:4313}, end: {_id:2459}, properties:{evidence:"Middle cerebral artery occlusion (MCAO) induced development of ischemia, and ischemic neuronal cell death were reduced in IL-32Î±-overexpressing transgenic mice (IL-32Î± mice) brain through the decreased release of neuroinflammatory cytokines (IL-6, IL-1beta, TNF-Î±) and activation of astrocytes, but enhancement of anti- ne