one H3 lysine 4 methylation at the APP promoter and that chemical inhibitors of histone deacetylases and histone lysine demethylase abrogate T3-dependent APP silencing.", pmid:"21458529", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"21458529"}}, {start: {_id:4533}, end: {_id:4679}, properties:{annotationEncodeFeatureTypes:["Promoter"], evidence:"We found that bilateral microinjection of amyloid beta (Abeta)1-40 fibrils into the hippocampal CA1 area of resulted in significant upregulation of CX3CR1 messenger RNA (mRNA) and protein expression (via increasing histone H3 acetylation in the Cx3cr1 promoter region), synaptic dysfunction, and cognitive impairment,", annotationMeshanatomy:["Hippocampus"], pmid:"23855980", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"23855980"}}, {start: {_id:4921}, end: {_id:4922}, properties:{evidence:"Nfe2l1, Egr1 and Usf2 emerge among regulators of genes involved in AD (e.g. Dhcr24, Aplp2, Tia1, Pdrx1, Vdac1, and Syn2).", annotationSubgraph:["Cholesterol metabolism subgraph"], annotationConfidence:["High"], pmid:"27050105", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"27050105"}}, {start: {_id:4921}, end: {_id:4923}, properties:{evidence:"Nfe2l1, Egr1 and Usf2 emerge among regulators of genes involved in AD (e.g. Dhcr24, Aplp2, Tia1, Pdrx1, Vdac1, and Syn2).", annotationSubgraph:["Amyloidogenic subgraph"], annotationConfidence:["High"], pmid:"27050105", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"27050105"}}] AS row
