 of genes involved in AD (e.g. Dhcr24, Aplp2, Tia1, Pdrx1, Vdac1, and Syn2).", annotationSubgraph:["Gamma secretase subgraph"], annotationConfidence:["High"], pmid:"27050105", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"27050105"}}, {start: {_id:2100}, end: {_id:4926}, properties:{evidence:"Nfe2l1, Egr1 and Usf2 emerge among regulators of genes involved in AD (e.g. Dhcr24, Aplp2, Tia1, Pdrx1, Vdac1, and Syn2).", annotationSubgraph:["Gamma secretase subgraph"], annotationConfidence:["High"], pmid:"27050105", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"27050105"}}, {start: {_id:4927}, end: {_id:4922}, properties:{evidence:"Nfe2l1, Egr1 and Usf2 emerge among regulators of genes involved in AD (e.g. Dhcr24, Aplp2, Tia1, Pdrx1, Vdac1, and Syn2).", annotationSubgraph:["Cholesterol metabolism subgraph"], annotationConfidence:["High"], pmid:"27050105", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"27050105"}}, {start: {_id:4927}, end: {_id:4923}, properties:{evidence:"Nfe2l1, Egr1 and Usf2 emerge among regulators of genes involved in AD (e.g. Dhcr24, Aplp2, Tia1, Pdrx1, Vdac1, and Syn2).", annotationSubgraph:["Amyloidogenic subgraph"], annotationConfidence:["High"], pmid:"27050105", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"27050105"}}, {start: {_id:4927}, end: {_id:4924}, properties:{evidence:"Nfe2l1, Egr1 and Usf2 emerge among regulators of genes involved in AD (e.g. Dhcr24, Aplp2, Tia1, Pdrx1, Vdac1, and Syn2).", pmid:"27050105", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"27050105"}}, {start: {_id:4927}, end: {_id:4925}, properties:{evidence:"Nfe2l1, Egr1 and Usf2 emerge among regulators of genes involved in AD (e.g. Dhcr24, Aplp2, Tia1, Pdrx1, Vdac1, and Syn2).", pmid:"27050105", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"27050105"}}, {start: {_id:4927}, end: {_id:4926}, properties:{evidence:"Nfe2l1, Egr1 and Usf2 emerge among regulators of genes involved in AD (e.g. Dhcr24, Aplp2, Tia1, Pdrx1, Vdac1, and Syn2).", pmid:"27050105", citationType:"PubMed", citationRef:"27050105"}}] AS row
